{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "e3728821b9916e07a7d5d908294a24038c0df0d95cfb892b8377ee88a032b2ef",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0001",
      "text": "Late-epoch bonding allows users to capture disproportionate epoch rewards",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 73,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0002",
      "text": "## Finding description and impact",
      "start": 75,
      "end": 108,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0003",
      "text": "----",
      "start": 110,
      "end": 114,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0004",
      "text": "### Summary",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 127,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0005",
      "text": "Rewards for each epoch are calculated using the user's veTRUST balance at the **end of the epoch**. Because the system relies on a single timestamp snapshot, users who bond immediately before epoch close can receive the same reward share as users who participated throughout the entire epoch.",
      "start": 129,
      "end": 421,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0006",
      "text": "This allows attackers to capture a disproportionate share of emissions while only participating for a negligible portion of the epoch.",
      "start": 423,
      "end": 557,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0007",
      "text": "----",
      "start": 559,
      "end": 563,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0008",
      "text": "### Root Cause",
      "start": 565,
      "end": 579,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0009",
      "text": "Reward calculation uses the user balance at epoch end:",
      "start": 581,
      "end": 635,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0010",
      "text": "`_userEligibleRewardsForEpoch()`",
      "start": 637,
      "end": 669,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0011",
      "text": "[File: src/protocol/emissions/TrustBonding.sol#L475-L492](https://github.com/code-423n4/2026-03-intuition/blob/314b7d4d9ccbaf27e4484a6c0706af83d3f75f36/src/protocol/emissions/TrustBonding.sol#L475-L492)",
      "start": 670,
      "end": 872,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0012",
      "text": "The balance is obtained from:",
      "start": 873,
      "end": 902,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0013",
      "text": "`userBondedBalanceAtEpochEnd()`",
      "start": 904,
      "end": 935,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0014",
      "text": "[File: src/protocol/emissions/TrustBonding.sol#L203-L213](https://github.com/code-423n4/2026-03-intuition/blob/314b7d4d9ccbaf27e4484a6c0706af83d3f75f36/src/protocol/emissions/TrustBonding.sol#L203-L213)",
      "start": 936,
      "end": 1138,
      "line": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0015",
      "text": "Because balances are evaluated only at the epoch end timestamp, the system ignores **how long the user held veTRUST during the epoch**.",
      "start": 1139,
      "end": 1274,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0016",
      "text": "----",
      "start": 1276,
      "end": 1280,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0017",
      "text": "### Attack Path",
      "start": 1282,
      "end": 1297,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0018",
      "text": "1. Honest users bond at the beginning of the epoch.",
      "start": 1299,
      "end": 1350,
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0019",
      "text": "2. Attacker waits until the last seconds of the epoch.",
      "start": 1351,
      "end": 1405,
      "line": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0020",
      "text": "3. Attacker bonds a large amount of TRUST with a long lock.",
      "start": 1406,
      "end": 1465,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0021",
      "text": "4. Epoch ends and rewards are calculated using the attacker's large veTRUST balance.",
      "start": 1466,
      "end": 1550,
      "line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0022",
      "text": "5. Attacker receives a majority of emissions despite participating briefly.",
      "start": 1551,
      "end": 1626,
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0023",
      "text": "This strategy can be repeated every epoch.",
      "start": 1628,
      "end": 1670,
      "line": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0024",
      "text": "----",
      "start": 1672,
      "end": 1676,
      "line": 39
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0025",
      "text": "### Impact",
      "start": 1678,
      "end": 1688,
      "line": 41
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0026",
      "text": "Late bonding allows attackers to dilute rewards for honest participants.",
      "start": 1690,
      "end": 1762,
      "line": 43
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0027",
      "text": "Example:",
      "start": 1764,
      "end": 1772,
      "line": 45
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0028",
      "text": "Alice bonds `1,000 TRUST` at epoch start.",
      "start": 1774,
      "end": 1815,
      "line": 47
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0029",
      "text": "Bob bonds `9,000 TRUST` **1 second before epoch end**.",
      "start": 1818,
      "end": 1872,
      "line": 48
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0030",
      "text": "At epoch close:",
      "start": 1874,
      "end": 1889,
      "line": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0031",
      "text": "`Alice ≈ 1,000 veTRUST`",
      "start": 1891,
      "end": 1914,
      "line": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0032",
      "text": "`Bob ≈ 9,000 veTRUST`",
      "start": 1917,
      "end": 1938,
      "line": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0033",
      "text": "Reward distribution:",
      "start": 1940,
      "end": 1960,
      "line": 55
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0034",
      "text": "`Bob ≈ 90% of emissions`",
      "start": 1962,
      "end": 1986,
      "line": 57
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0035",
      "text": "`Alice ≈ 10%`",
      "start": 1989,
      "end": 2002,
      "line": 58
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0036",
      "text": "Despite Alice participating for the entire epoch, Bob captures the majority of rewards after bonding only seconds before epoch close.",
      "start": 2004,
      "end": 2137,
      "line": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e3728821b991_0037",
      "text": "----",
      "start": 2139,
      "end": 2143,
      "line": 62
    }
  ]
}
